WEBVTT

00:05:59.373 --> 00:06:01.231
To give you a sense of the flavor of the meeting,

00:06:01.231 --> 00:06:04.532
it occurs right before happy hour.

00:06:04.532 --> 00:06:06.608
Anyone who comes can vote.

00:06:06.608 --> 00:06:07.920
The most important rule is

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:11.049
that you can vote with only one hand.

00:06:11.049 --> 00:06:14.513
In the past, some of the winners have been

00:06:14.513 --> 00:06:16.998
"tweet" in 2009

00:06:16.998 --> 00:06:20.403
and "hashtag" in 2012.

00:06:20.403 --> 00:06:23.462
"Chad" was the word of the year in the year 2000,

00:06:23.462 --> 00:06:27.282
because who knew what a chad was before 2000,

00:06:27.282 --> 00:06:31.696
and "WMD" in 2002.